  "tier": "1",
  "domain": "tier1/pilot/wand-v1-float",
  "description": "Float recording of the Tier 1 Wand v1 golden (phase1/tier1/wand-v1; decisions 099 and 283), so that its infinite padding can be scored on the document's own values: the Wand's Height is L16F, and each PNG 16 code of the golden has several L16F preimages (decisions 277 and 281). Steps 1 to 3 and every input are the Wand v1 golden's, byte for byte (the three UzmiGames pipeline scripts and their arguments, the stack, the masks, the mesh and the mesh maps, all pinned by SHA-256), run with the same two recorder adaptations. Step 4 is the recorder's own export of the same document after every script export: the authored configuration export-config.json exports BaseColor, Roughness, Metallic and Height from the same document maps and channels as painter_export.py, as OpenEXR 32f with the script's parameters otherwise (sizeLog2 11, infinite padding, no dithering), each file name the script's with the suffix _f32, into a fresh directory of its own. The run's PNG 16 maps must equal the Wand v1 golden's byte for byte, which proves it is the same document. Recordings: r1 (same session: create, sync, export, float export), r1-repeat (same session, both exports again) and r2 (after save, close and reopen, both exports again). Recorded on Painter 12.1.5.",
